{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":238749,\"title\":\"A Very Merry Mix-Up\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Shop owner Alice Chapman is nervous to meet her future in-laws at Christmas, especially because she is arriving ahead of her new fiance Will Mitchum. Alice's trip becomes more stressful when her luggage is lost and her phone is damaged, leaving her no way to find Will's family!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7WwGwKE9yMB90EsXduuPTX3iBbL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ic1CVzOFrnlWp1g6tPgAXUAjVb.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":90,\"year\":2013,\"runtime\":86,\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jonathan Wright\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":207180,\"name\":\"Jonathan Wright\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zi1roGouFMONsRKEUJwLXlCW1OX.jpg\"},{\"id\":3128,\"name\":\"Alicia Witt\",\"character\":\"Alice\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vQ2McAjHjY3A7oDrPMx6aLSsvkW.jpg\"},{\"id\":136963,\"name\":\"Mark Wiebe\",\"character\":\"Matt\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aInAEZsYrIQ8NiT4gt7vkZGPm4J.jpg\"},{\"id\":63859,\"name\":\"Scott Gibson\",\"character\":\"Will\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yKqoZbEZQnMaCK5ik72C5oPSO6v.jpg\"},{\"id\":71763,\"name\":\"Susan Hogan\",\"character\":\"Penny\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9gwOXpJOCPd6cGh4vKd2C9H7njl.jpg\"},{\"id\":44103,\"name\":\"Richard Fitzpatrick\",\"character\":\"Joe\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/13X88hBjNjDE0KliGIWmfX1ZjAa.jpg\"},{\"id\":36173,\"name\":\"Lawrence Dane\",\"character\":\"Charles\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u67sYvj2kblUIbWxG88pGP7gdyY.jpg\"},{\"id\":65471,\"name\":\"Mimi Kuzyk\",\"character\":\"Judith\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tD2W9YbUPQWzouJIKD1hfmP94GH.jpg\"},{\"id\":174580,\"name\":\"Judah Katz\",\"character\":\"Roy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gtujFQTIkQZPmJtJE3x5rI12117.jpg\"},{\"id\":76514,\"name\":\"Justin Mader\",\"character\":\"Billy Mitchum\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xTJUb0jua71OvbIsEhBZT9i1OTc.jpg\"},{\"id\":29466,\"name\":\"Russell Yuen\",\"character\":\"Dr. Stark\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cn8RUzHx1RpgSrHJ3IBQ2DS3iX5.jpg\"},{\"id\":2550739,\"name\":\"Alison Jutzi\",\"character\":\"Airport Employee\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":141217,\"name\":\"David Reale\",\"character\":\"Jeremy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Mo33Tpd9Ou7nRjKjZ1iMBc2jq0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1239425,\"name\":\"Howard Hoover\",\"character\":\"Grant Lockley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tBP8LE3YU0AK4ZaBRSh5jrWikPQ.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":79113,\"title\":\"A Princess for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her sister and brother-in-law's tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law's father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81250,\"title\":\"Geek Charming\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xweQBQSYQyHKiUxN1nCDQbLvJE0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5btPLADkUW3gxzIs25VdqRAOMtB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Film geek Josh is looking for the subject of his new documentary when a chance meeting puts the perfect star in his sights—Dylan, his school's most popular junior. But Dylan's hopes of using the film to become Blossom Queen don't quite match with Josh's goal to make a hard-hitting exposé about popularity. Will Josh shoot the film as planned, or show Dylan as the truly interesting person she is?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1028556,\"title\":\"Haul Out the Holly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/naX9S52wyTpUJPR80FIWhgxzufb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29qiSnPp8LN1vUomrMN3MMVwlUH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Emily arrives home, hoping to visit her parents, only to discover that they are leaving on a trip of their own. As she stays at their house for the holidays, their HOA is determined to get Emily to participate in the neighborhood’s many Christmas festivities.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299576,\"title\":\"The Nine Lives of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d3Nw4grn02Ca5AmOiRcZLgrAL2k.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5dutPpjtI5sX8vJAwrVBVdR8bCC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With Christmas approaching, a handsome fireman afraid of commitment adopts a stray cat and meets a beautiful veterinary student who challenges his decision to remain a confirmed bachelor.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":566039,\"title\":\"Christmas with a Prince\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f36niI1QKbUUN7hh6lbeIEUIv4P.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4PqktwV3aQr9fadJIljF9OFwdYq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pediatric specialist Tasha Mason is focused on one thing; keeping the kids in her ward as healthy and happy as possible. So when her high-school crush, who just happens to be handsome Prince Alexander Cavalieri, breaks his leg on a nearby ski-slope, Tasha is forced to allow him to secretly get well on her floor and she’s furious that a spoiled Royal is interrupting the precious healing time her kids so badly need. Soon, however, Tasha learns that some tough love and a lot of Christmas spirit, could turn this royal pain into a knight in shining armor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":409447,\"title\":\"Hairspray Live!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3T1u2DzwfDUd5iMNw4gqFWQx3P2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8lqaouqbfPzFLRpuqaZkbtbT6hP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenage girl living in Baltimore in the early 1960s dreams of appearing on a popular TV dance show.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":474979,\"title\":\"Royal New Year's Eve\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rNzJ3GZqT1L3uszZMjqsmzuD3L6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fdoN0vzVXuPQbR0nHWnTYOhf6dZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aspiring fashion designer falls in love with her socialite client's prospective fiance, Prince Jeffrey.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":28201,\"title\":\"The Girl in the Café\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rk3hm0syx3eBvov0uLFaZv9Rr4R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ide7GiURV1XN0r3RpiKoFwfD9E3.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lawrence, an aging, lonely civil servant falls for Gina, an enigmatic young woman. When he takes her to the G8 Summit in Reykjavik, however, their bond is tested by Lawrence's professional obligations.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":71885,\"title\":\"Motocrossed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Us6BhiUfqfenFF7NjouXG81guK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zwFJcd6qMppTb5VbXKQxkMkp2wY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Andrea Carson who loves motocross, despite her father finding her unsuited for the sport, being that she is \\\"just a girl\\\". When her twin brother Andrew breaks his leg just before a big race, their father is forced to go to Europe to find a replacement rider. In the meantime, Andrea secretly races in Andrew's place with her mother's help.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":145312,\"title\":\"Dear Santa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1UDzXg6R7K26aBjMpxk9WbQTrpm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mAbDuA5s5fTkc8JltJGWYFkj6ml.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Crystal, a rich party girl, finds a little girl's letter to Santa asking for a new mother, and she vows to win over the father and daughter before the holidays.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":369058,\"title\":\"Merry Kissmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0qMSI9jzrEvErC66eCdkM6W1yu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/siDpHlHQvZli9QRJfEsVXbQe7kV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Unwinding her relationship from a controlling choreographer, Kayla happens to take an elevator ride with lonesome caterer “Dustin”. The lift stalls, and spontaneously, magical kisses follow. Soon the choreographer makes nice, and Dustin retreats. Kayla becomes confused as to which man to love.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840430,\"title\":\"The Holdovers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/VHSzNBTwxV8vh7wylo7O9CLdac.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/57fhbxl9is7W7ur5v6UuvlNsoSg.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A curmudgeonly instructor at a New England prep school is forced to remain on campus during Christmas break to babysit the handful of students with nowhere to go. Eventually, he forms an unlikely bond with one of them — a damaged, brainy troublemaker — and with the school’s head cook, who has just lost a son in Vietnam.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"llpTYlMZzzo\",\"name\":\"Hallmark Channel - A Very Merry Mix-Up - Premiere Promo\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}